{"description":"This one is different.\nOn October 16th, The Domino Club is taking over United Boxing Club for our first-ever domino tournament.\nWe’re bringing the tables into the space and putting players head-to-head for a night of competition, energy, music, food, and good vibes.\n40 teams. 80 players. One champion team.\nExpect a full night of dominoes, with teams battling through multiple rounds before the competition moves into the ring for the semi-finals and final.\nWhether you’re stepping up to play or coming through to take in the action, there’ll be plenty happening around you.\nSound selection by: @Tremayne\nHosted by: @OverproofPapi\nFood by: @9MILE\n\nFollow us on socials:\nInstagram: @dominoclub_to\nTikTok: @dominoclub_to\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n\nTHE TOURNAMENT\n🎲 40 teams of 2\n🔥 Multiple rounds of competition\n🥊 Semi-finals + Final in the ring\n🏆 Grand prize ($1000 value) for the winning team + goody bags for all participating teams\n🎤 Hosted by Overproof Papi\nDon't have a partner? Grab a Solo Player ticket and we'll match you with another solo player before the tournament.\nDrinks will be available for purchase throughout the night, while complimentary light bites including patties will be available for all guests.\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAdditional Notes\nManners is a must; Introduce yourself at the table and get to know who you're playing against.\nTrash talk is encouraged, but respect is required. For guests, staff, and for those building their confidence and learning and playing. Everyone starts somewhere.\nBy attending, you consent to being photographed or filmed for event content. Prefer to stay off-camera? Let us know!\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\n\nCancelation & Refund Policy\nTickets for this event will be non-refundable","organizer":"The Domino Club"}